+## Official server output
+
+`get_objects_summary` returns a collection tree; deduplicate object names when
+counting objects in multiple collections. Object details include dimensions but
+no vertex/triangle counts or bounding-box corners. Measure those through
+`execute_blender_code` on the evaluated object; call `calc_loop_triangles()` for
+triangles and release temporary meshes with `to_mesh_clear()`.
+
+The render helpers write under Blender's MCP scratch directory using the basename
+of `output_path`. Use the returned `filepath` to find the actual image. Thumbnail
+rendering uses the scene camera and does not automatically frame an object.
 
